{"4457150":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Chomp Garden","steam_appid":4457150,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chomp Garden is a puzzle game about guiding plants with light.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To catch up with your pup, you enter a garden full of strange plants.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chomp Plants grow toward the light, Thief Plants move away from it, and Hidey Bushes can hide your light.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny lamp. Use your light to shape plants, solve puzzles, open the way forward, explore the garden, and find your pup.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtfully crafted puzzles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and surprising plant behaviors<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little secrets hidden throughout the garden<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compact 1–2 hour puzzle experience<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chomp Garden is a puzzle game about guiding plants with light.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To catch up with your pup, you enter a garden full of strange plants.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chomp Plants grow toward the light, Thief Plants move away from it, and Hidey Bushes can hide your light.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny lamp. Use your light to shape plants, solve puzzles, open the way forward, explore the garden, and find your pup.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtfully crafted puzzles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and surprising plant behaviors<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little secrets hidden throughout the garden<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compact 1–2 hour puzzle experience<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A bite-sized puzz